BT 1 0 0 1 0 48.9 Tm /F1 10.3 Tf 14.8 TL (The ten "brains" are useful business categories. We would initially treat them as connected) Tj T* (capabilities over shared client, case, document and decision records. Building ten independent) Tj T* (systems would introduce unnecessary duplication and make consistent access and reporting harder) Tj T* (to manage.) Tj T* ET
